 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored over the factory draft from the archived crops. The 2021-2022 crops are the building site or scaffold, so only 2024-2025 crops were read.",
  "Group 0: panel 160 (S face of the west block, 27.8 m) -> left 0-28 m of w01-164 2025-06-30, 9 bays, 6 storeys, slabs on storeys 1-5. Group 1: panel 13 (S face of the east block, 21.7 m) -> right 42.5-64 m of w01-164 2025-06-30, 7 bays, 7 storeys. Group 2: panel 170 (W, Sausalitolaan, 32.6 m) -> w02-254d25 2024-10-21 (the primary w02-254 2022-12-27 is scaffold), 10 bays, lobby with mailboxes and two glass doors at bays 4-6. Group 3: panel 2 (E, 13 m) -> w05-74 2025-06-30 (trees over the lower storeys). Group 4: panel 150 (N, 11.6 m) -> w07-344 2024-10-21.",
  "Panel 151 (N, west block) has only a crop occluded by the neighbour's balconies (w08-344, w08-344d25); panels 8 and 7 (Batteryparkstraat) and the courtyard and set-back top-storey panels have no crop and take otherWalls window-grid.",
  "The slabs are balconyBands spans at the kit's deepest (0.7 of a storey); the photo's slabs are about 2.5-3 m deep, staggered in depth as well as along the wall, with 0.5-0.7 m thick fascias and a mix of solid parapets and white bar railings. One depth and one railing kind per group is a kit limit, reported."
 ],
